(function(){var T=window.TRANSLATIONS;if(!T)return;var d={"tr":{"blog_p84_cylbracket_title":"Hidrolik Silindir Bağlantı Braketi İmalatı: Pim Yuvası, Kaynak ve Yorulma | ArmaWeld","blog_p84_cylbracket_meta_desc":"İş makineleri, tarım makineleri, presler ve kaldırma ekipmanlarında hidrolik silindir bağlantı braketlerinin (çatal kulak, mafsal yuvası) imalatı: pim deliği hizası, kaynak sonrası işleme, burç, yorulma detayları ve muayene.","blog_p84_cylbracket_og_title":"Hidrolik silindir bağlantı braketi","blog_p84_cylbracket_tag":"Ürün Rehberi · Hidrolik","blog_p84_cylbracket_h1":"Hidrolik Silindir Bağlantı Braketi İmalatı: Pim Yuvası, Kaynak ve Yorulma","blog_p84_cylbracket_breadcrumb3":"Silindir bağlantı braketi","blog_p84_cylbracket_read":"6 dk okuma","blog_p84_cylbracket_body":"<p>Bir hidrolik silindirin ürettiği kuvvet, makineye iki küçük bağlantı noktası üzerinden aktarılır: silindir gövdesi tarafındaki ve mil ucu tarafındaki braketler. Bu braketler kaynaklı parçanın geri kalanına göre küçüktür ama makinenin en çok zorlanan, en sık yük değiştiren bölgeleridir. Sahada görülen pek çok çatlak, pim ve burç aşınması bu bölgelerden başlar.</p>\n<h2>Tipik Braket Türleri</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Çatal kulak (clevis):</strong> İki paralel plaka ve aralarından geçen pim.</li>\n<li><strong>Tek kulak:</strong> Silindirin çatal ucuna giren tek plaka, çoğunlukla küresel mafsallı.</li>\n<li><strong>Muylu (trunnion) yatağı:</strong> Silindirin ortasından taşındığı iki yataklı bağlantı.</li>\n<li><strong>Ayak (foot) bağlantısı:</strong> Silindirin gövdeden cıvatalandığı taban plakası.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Pim Yuvası Hizası</h2>\n<p>Çatal kulakta iki plakadaki deliklerin eş eksenli olması, pimin kasılmadan girmesi ve burçların eşit aşınması için şarttır. Kaynak sırasında plakalar içe doğru çekilir ve delikler kayar. Bu nedenle hassas pim yuvaları genellikle kaynak sonrasında tek bağlamada işlenir; kaynak öncesi delik açılacaksa işleme payı bırakılır (bkz. <a href=\"kaynak-sonrasi-talasli-isleme.html\">kaynak sonrası talaşlı işleme</a>). Silindirin iki ucundaki braketlerin birbirine göre hizası da, silindir milinde yanal yük oluşmaması için önemlidir.</p>\n<h2>Kaynak ve Yorulma</h2>\n<p>Silindir braketleri her çalışma çevriminde yük alır ve bırakır; bu yorulma yüküdür. Yorulma ömrünü belirleyen en önemli etken kaynak detayıdır:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Kulak plakalarının ana gövdeye tam nüfuziyetle bağlanması, köşe kaynağına göre daha yüksek yorulma sınıfı sağlar (bkz. <a href=\"kaynakli-baglantilarda-yorulma-fat-sinifi.html\">yorulma ve FAT sınıfı</a>).</li>\n<li>Kaynak bitişlerinin plaka köşelerinde değil, uzağında olması (sarma veya köşede durmama).</li>\n<li>Gerektiğinde kaynak ayağının taşlanması veya TIG ile yumuşatılması (bkz. <a href=\"kaynak-dikisi-taslama-ne-zaman-gerekli.html\">kaynak dikişi taşlama</a>).</li>\n<li>Braket arkasında yükü yayan takviye; ince sac gövdeye doğrudan kulak kaynaklanmaması.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Burç ve Yağlama</h2>\n<p>Pim yuvasına genellikle değiştirilebilir burç preslenir. Burç yuvası toleransı (pres geçme), gres kanalı ve gresörlük deliği çizimde tanımlanmalıdır. Burç preslemesi boya sonrasında yapılır; boya yuvaya girmemelidir.</p>\n<h2>Muayene</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Kulak kaynaklarında VT ve MT; tam nüfuziyetli dikişlerde UT.</li>\n<li>Pim delikleri arası mesafe, eş eksenlilik ve çap ölçümü.</li>\n<li>Silindirin iki bağlantısı arasındaki montaj mesafesi.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>ArmaWeld'de:</strong> Silindir braketli kaynaklı gövdeleri çizime göre kaynaklıyor, MT ve UT muayenelerini ISO 9712 Seviye 2 personelimizle yapıyoruz. Pim yuvalarının kaynak sonrası işlenmesini iş ortağımız talaşlı işleme atölyeleriyle koordine ediyor, delik ölçülerini raporluyoruz. <a href=\"../makine-sasesi-imalati.html\">Makine şasesi imalatı →</a></p></div>","blog_p84_cylbracket_faq":"<h2>Sık Sorulan Sorular</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Pim delikleri kaynaktan önce mi sonra mı açılmalı?</h3><p>Hassas yuvalar genellikle kaynak sonrasında tek bağlamada işlenir; önce açılacaksa işleme payı bırakılır.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Silindir braketleri neden çatlar?</h3><p>Her çevrimde yük değiştiği için yorulma oluşur; zayıf kaynak detayı ve kaynak bitişlerinin köşelerde olması ana nedenlerdir.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Burç ne zaman preslenir?</h3><p>Boya sonrasında; yuvaya boya girmemelidir.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Braketlerde hangi NDT uygulanır?</h3><p>VT ve MT; tam nüfuziyetli dikişlerde UT.</p></div>","blog_p84_cylbracket_cta_h3":"Silindir bağlantılı kaynaklı parçalarınız mı var?","blog_p84_cylbracket_cta_p":"Çizimi gönderin; kaynak, işleme ve muayeneyi kapsayan teklif hazırlayalım.","blog_p84_cylbracket_cta_btn":"Teklif İste →","blog_related_h":"İlgili Makaleler","blog_p18_fatigue_h1":"Kaynaklı Bağlantılarda Yorulma: FAT Sınıfı, S-N Eğrisi ve Ömrü Uzatan Detaylar","blog_p54_postmachining_h1":"Kaynak Sonrası Talaşlı İşleme: Kaynaklı Parçayı Hassas Ölçüye Getirmek","blog_p58_bucket_h1":"İş Makinesi Kova ve Ataşman İmalatı: Kaynak, Aşınma ve Pim Yuvaları","blog_hidrolik_sistem_imalat_h1":"Hidrolik ve Pnömatik Sistem Kaynaklı İmalatı"},"en":{"blog_p84_cylbracket_title":"Hydraulic Cylinder Mounting Brackets: Pin Bores, Welding and Fatigue | ArmaWeld","blog_p84_cylbracket_meta_desc":"Manufacturing hydraulic cylinder mounting brackets (clevises, lugs, trunnion blocks) for construction, agricultural and lifting equipment and presses: pin bore alignment, post-weld machining, bushings, fatigue details and inspection.","blog_p84_cylbracket_og_title":"Hydraulic cylinder mounting brackets","blog_p84_cylbracket_tag":"Product Guide · Hydraulics","blog_p84_cylbracket_h1":"Hydraulic Cylinder Mounting Brackets: Pin Bores, Welding and Fatigue","blog_p84_cylbracket_breadcrumb3":"Cylinder mounting brackets","blog_p84_cylbracket_read":"6 min read","blog_p84_cylbracket_body":"<p>The force a hydraulic cylinder produces is transferred to the machine through two small connection points: the brackets on the barrel side and on the rod end. They are small compared with the rest of the welded part, yet they are among the most heavily stressed and most frequently cycled areas of the machine. Many cracks and much pin and bushing wear in the field start here.</p>\n<h2>Typical Bracket Types</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Clevis:</strong> two parallel plates with a pin through them.</li>\n<li><strong>Single lug:</strong> a single plate that fits into the cylinder's clevis, often with a spherical bearing.</li>\n<li><strong>Trunnion block:</strong> a two-bearing mount carrying the cylinder from its middle.</li>\n<li><strong>Foot mount:</strong> a base plate to which the cylinder is bolted.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Pin Bore Alignment</h2>\n<p>In a clevis, the holes in the two plates must be coaxial so the pin goes in without binding and the bushings wear evenly. During welding the plates pull inwards and the holes shift. Precision pin bores are therefore usually machined after welding in a single setup; if holes are made before welding, machining allowance is left (see <a href=\"kaynak-sonrasi-talasli-isleme.html\">post-weld machining</a>). Alignment between the brackets at both cylinder ends also matters, so that no side load reaches the cylinder rod.</p>\n<h2>Welding and Fatigue</h2>\n<p>Cylinder brackets are loaded and unloaded every working cycle: a fatigue load. The weld detail is the main driver of fatigue life:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Attaching lug plates to the main body with full penetration gives a higher fatigue class than fillet welds (see <a href=\"kaynakli-baglantilarda-yorulma-fat-sinifi.html\">fatigue and FAT class</a>).</li>\n<li>Weld stops away from plate corners (wrap-around, no stopping at the corner).</li>\n<li>Toe grinding or TIG dressing where needed (see <a href=\"kaynak-dikisi-taslama-ne-zaman-gerekli.html\">weld grinding</a>).</li>\n<li>Back-up reinforcement that spreads load; no lugs welded directly to thin sheet.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Bushings and Lubrication</h2>\n<p>A replaceable bushing is normally pressed into the pin bore. The bore tolerance (press fit), grease groove and grease nipple hole must be defined on the drawing. Bushings are pressed after painting; paint must not enter the bore.</p>\n<h2>Inspection</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>VT and MT on lug welds; UT on full-penetration welds.</li>\n<li>Pin hole centre distance, coaxiality and diameter.</li>\n<li>Installed distance between the two cylinder mounts.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>At ArmaWeld:</strong> we weld bodies with cylinder brackets to drawing and our ISO 9712 Level 2 staff carry out MT and UT. Post-weld machining of pin bores is coordinated with our partner machine shops and bore dimensions are reported. <a href=\"../makine-sasesi-imalati.html\">Machine frame manufacturing →</a></p></div>","blog_p84_cylbracket_faq":"<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Should pin holes be made before or after welding?</h3><p>Precision bores are usually machined after welding in one setup; if made before, machining allowance is left.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Why do cylinder brackets crack?</h3><p>Load changes every cycle, causing fatigue; poor weld details and weld stops at corners are the main causes.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>When are bushings pressed in?</h3><p>After painting; paint must not enter the bore.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Which NDT is used on brackets?</h3><p>VT and MT; UT on full-penetration welds.</p></div>","blog_p84_cylbracket_cta_h3":"Do you have welded parts with cylinder mounts?","blog_p84_cylbracket_cta_p":"Send the drawing; we will quote welding, machining and inspection.","blog_p84_cylbracket_cta_btn":"Request a Quote →","blog_related_h":"Related Articles","blog_p18_fatigue_h1":"Fatigue in Welded Joints: FAT Classes, S-N Curves and Details That Extend Life","blog_p54_postmachining_h1":"Machining After Welding: Bringing Welded Parts to Precision Dimensions","blog_p58_bucket_h1":"Excavator Bucket and Attachment Fabrication: Welding, Wear and Pin Bores","blog_hidrolik_sistem_imalat_h1":"Welded Manufacturing of Hydraulic and Pneumatic Systems"},"de":{"blog_p84_cylbracket_title":"Hydraulikzylinder-Lagerböcke fertigen: Bolzenbohrungen, Schweißen und Ermüdung | ArmaWeld","blog_p84_cylbracket_meta_desc":"Fertigung von Zylinderlagerböcken (Gabelköpfe, Laschen, Schwenkzapfenlager) für Bau-, Land- und Hebetechnik sowie Pressen: Fluchtung der Bolzenbohrungen, Bearbeitung nach dem Schweißen, Buchsen, Ermüdungsdetails und Prüfung.","blog_p84_cylbracket_og_title":"Hydraulikzylinder-Lagerböcke","blog_p84_cylbracket_tag":"Produktleitfaden · Hydraulik","blog_p84_cylbracket_h1":"Hydraulikzylinder-Lagerböcke fertigen: Bolzenbohrungen, Schweißen und Ermüdung","blog_p84_cylbracket_breadcrumb3":"Zylinderlagerböcke","blog_p84_cylbracket_read":"6 Min. Lesezeit","blog_p84_cylbracket_body":"<p>Die Kraft eines Hydraulikzylinders gelangt über zwei kleine Anschlusspunkte in die Maschine: die Lagerböcke an Zylinderrohr und Kolbenstangenende. Gemessen am restlichen Schweißteil sind sie klein, gehören aber zu den am stärksten und häufigsten wechselbeanspruchten Stellen. Viele Risse und viel Bolzen- und Buchsenverschleiß im Einsatz beginnen hier.</p>\n<h2>Typische Bauformen</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Gabelkopf:</strong> zwei parallele Laschen mit durchgehendem Bolzen.</li>\n<li><strong>Einzellasche:</strong> eine Lasche, die in die Gabel des Zylinders greift, oft mit Gelenklager.</li>\n<li><strong>Schwenkzapfenlager:</strong> zweiseitige Lagerung des Zylinders in der Mitte.</li>\n<li><strong>Fußbefestigung:</strong> Grundplatte, an die der Zylinder geschraubt wird.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Fluchtung der Bolzenbohrungen</h2>\n<p>Beim Gabelkopf müssen die Bohrungen beider Laschen fluchten, damit der Bolzen nicht klemmt und die Buchsen gleichmäßig verschleißen. Beim Schweißen ziehen sich die Laschen nach innen, die Bohrungen wandern. Präzise Bolzenbohrungen werden daher meist nach dem Schweißen in einer Aufspannung bearbeitet; werden sie vorher gebohrt, bleibt Bearbeitungszugabe (siehe <a href=\"kaynak-sonrasi-talasli-isleme.html\">Bearbeitung nach dem Schweißen</a>). Auch die Fluchtung der Lagerböcke an beiden Zylinderenden zueinander zählt, damit keine Querkraft auf die Kolbenstange wirkt.</p>\n<h2>Schweißen und Ermüdung</h2>\n<p>Zylinderlagerböcke werden in jedem Arbeitsspiel be- und entlastet: Ermüdungsbeanspruchung. Das Nahtdetail bestimmt die Lebensdauer maßgeblich:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Durchgeschweißte Laschenanschlüsse erreichen eine höhere Kerbfallklasse als Kehlnähte (siehe <a href=\"kaynakli-baglantilarda-yorulma-fat-sinifi.html\">Ermüdung und FAT-Klasse</a>).</li>\n<li>Nahtenden nicht an Blechecken (umschweißen, nicht an der Ecke absetzen).</li>\n<li>Bei Bedarf Nahtübergang beschleifen oder WIG-nachbehandeln (siehe <a href=\"kaynak-dikisi-taslama-ne-zaman-gerekli.html\">Nähte beschleifen</a>).</li>\n<li>Hinterlegte Verstärkung zur Lastverteilung; keine Lasche direkt auf dünnes Blech.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Buchsen und Schmierung</h2>\n<p>In die Bolzenbohrung wird meist eine austauschbare Buchse eingepresst. Bohrungstoleranz (Presspassung), Schmiernut und Schmiernippelbohrung gehören auf die Zeichnung. Buchsen werden nach dem Lackieren eingepresst; Lack darf nicht in die Bohrung.</p>\n<h2>Prüfung</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>VT und MT an Laschennähten; UT an durchgeschweißten Nähten.</li>\n<li>Bohrungsabstand, Koaxialität und Durchmesser.</li>\n<li>Einbaumaß zwischen beiden Zylinderanschlüssen.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Bei ArmaWeld:</strong> Wir schweißen Grundkörper mit Zylinderlagerböcken nach Zeichnung; MT und UT führt unser Personal mit ISO 9712 Stufe 2 durch. Die Bearbeitung der Bolzenbohrungen nach dem Schweißen koordinieren wir mit Partner-Zerspanungsbetrieben und dokumentieren die Maße. <a href=\"../makine-sasesi-imalati.html\">Maschinenrahmen →</a></p></div>","blog_p84_cylbracket_faq":"<h2>Häufige Fragen</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Bolzenbohrungen vor oder nach dem Schweißen?</h3><p>Präzisionsbohrungen meist nach dem Schweißen in einer Aufspannung; vorher gebohrt nur mit Bearbeitungszugabe.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Warum reißen Zylinderlagerböcke?</h3><p>Durch Ermüdung infolge wechselnder Last; schwache Nahtdetails und Nahtenden an Ecken sind Hauptursachen.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Wann werden Buchsen eingepresst?</h3><p>Nach dem Lackieren; kein Lack in die Bohrung.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Welche ZfP an Lagerböcken?</h3><p>VT und MT; UT an durchgeschweißten Nähten.</p></div>","blog_p84_cylbracket_cta_h3":"Schweißteile mit Zylinderanschlüssen?","blog_p84_cylbracket_cta_p":"Senden Sie die Zeichnung; wir bieten Schweißen, Bearbeitung und Prüfung an.","blog_p84_cylbracket_cta_btn":"Angebot anfordern →","blog_related_h":"Verwandte Artikel","blog_p18_fatigue_h1":"Ermüdung geschweißter Verbindungen: FAT-Klassen, Wöhlerlinie und lebensdauerverlängernde Details","blog_p54_postmachining_h1":"Mechanische Bearbeitung nach dem Schweißen: Schweißteile auf Präzisionsmaß bringen","blog_p58_bucket_h1":"Baggerlöffel und Anbaugeräte fertigen: Schweißen, Verschleiß und Bolzenaufnahmen","blog_hidrolik_sistem_imalat_h1":"Schweißfertigung hydraulischer und pneumatischer Systeme"},"es":{"blog_p84_cylbracket_title":"Soportes de cilindros hidráulicos: alojamientos de bulón, soldadura y fatiga | ArmaWeld","blog_p84_cylbracket_meta_desc":"Fabricación de soportes de cilindro hidráulico (horquillas, orejetas, soportes de muñón) para maquinaria de obra, agrícola, de elevación y prensas: alineación de alojamientos, mecanizado tras soldar, casquillos, detalles a fatiga e inspección.","blog_p84_cylbracket_og_title":"Soportes de cilindros hidráulicos","blog_p84_cylbracket_tag":"Guía de producto · Hidráulica","blog_p84_cylbracket_h1":"Soportes de cilindros hidráulicos: alojamientos de bulón, soldadura y fatiga","blog_p84_cylbracket_breadcrumb3":"Soportes de cilindro","blog_p84_cylbracket_read":"6 min de lectura","blog_p84_cylbracket_body":"<p>La fuerza de un cilindro hidráulico pasa a la máquina por dos pequeños puntos de unión: los soportes del lado de la camisa y del extremo del vástago. Son pequeños frente al resto de la pieza soldada, pero están entre las zonas más cargadas y con más ciclos de la máquina. Muchas grietas y desgastes de bulones y casquillos empiezan aquí.</p>\n<h2>Tipos habituales</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Horquilla:</strong> dos chapas paralelas atravesadas por un bulón.</li>\n<li><strong>Orejeta simple:</strong> una chapa que entra en la horquilla del cilindro, a menudo con rótula.</li>\n<li><strong>Soporte de muñón:</strong> apoyo con dos cojinetes que sujeta el cilindro por el centro.</li>\n<li><strong>Fijación por pie:</strong> placa base a la que se atornilla el cilindro.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Alineación de alojamientos</h2>\n<p>En una horquilla, los agujeros de ambas chapas deben ser coaxiales para que el bulón entre sin forzar y los casquillos se desgasten por igual. Al soldar, las chapas tiran hacia dentro y los agujeros se desplazan. Por eso los alojamientos de precisión suelen mecanizarse tras la soldadura en una sola atada; si se taladran antes, se deja sobremedida (ver <a href=\"kaynak-sonrasi-talasli-isleme.html\">mecanizado tras soldar</a>). También importa la alineación entre los soportes de ambos extremos, para que el vástago no reciba carga lateral.</p>\n<h2>Soldadura y fatiga</h2>\n<p>Los soportes se cargan y descargan en cada ciclo: es carga de fatiga. El detalle de soldadura es el factor principal de la vida a fatiga:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Unir las orejetas al cuerpo con penetración completa da una clase de fatiga mayor que los cordones en ángulo (ver <a href=\"kaynakli-baglantilarda-yorulma-fat-sinifi.html\">fatiga y clase FAT</a>).</li>\n<li>Finales de cordón lejos de las esquinas (rodear, no parar en la esquina).</li>\n<li>Amolado o repaso TIG del pie del cordón cuando sea necesario (ver <a href=\"kaynak-dikisi-taslama-ne-zaman-gerekli.html\">amolado de cordones</a>).</li>\n<li>Refuerzo posterior que reparta la carga; nunca orejetas sobre chapa fina.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Casquillos y engrase</h2>\n<p>En el alojamiento suele montarse a presión un casquillo sustituible. La tolerancia del alojamiento, la ranura y el agujero de engrasador deben definirse en el plano. Los casquillos se prensan tras pintar; la pintura no debe entrar en el alojamiento.</p>\n<h2>Inspección</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>VT y MT en cordones de orejetas; UT en penetración completa.</li>\n<li>Distancia entre ejes, coaxialidad y diámetro de los agujeros.</li>\n<li>Cota de montaje entre ambos anclajes del cilindro.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>En ArmaWeld:</strong> soldamos cuerpos con soportes de cilindro según plano y nuestro personal ISO 9712 nivel 2 realiza MT y UT. Coordinamos el mecanizado tras soldar con talleres socios e informamos las medidas de los alojamientos. <a href=\"../makine-sasesi-imalati.html\">Bastidores de máquina →</a></p></div>","blog_p84_cylbracket_faq":"<h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Agujeros antes o después de soldar?</h3><p>Los de precisión suelen mecanizarse tras soldar en una atada; si se hacen antes, con sobremedida.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Por qué se agrietan los soportes?</h3><p>Por fatiga al cambiar la carga en cada ciclo; detalles pobres y finales de cordón en esquinas son las causas principales.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Cuándo se montan los casquillos?</h3><p>Después de pintar; sin pintura en el alojamiento.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Qué END se aplican?</h3><p>VT y MT; UT en penetración completa.</p></div>","blog_p84_cylbracket_cta_h3":"¿Tiene piezas soldadas con anclajes de cilindro?","blog_p84_cylbracket_cta_p":"Envíe el plano; ofertaremos soldadura, mecanizado e inspección.","blog_p84_cylbracket_cta_btn":"Solicitar oferta →","blog_related_h":"Artículos relacionados","blog_p18_fatigue_h1":"Fatiga en uniones soldadas: clases FAT, curvas S-N y detalles que alargan la vida","blog_p54_postmachining_h1":"Mecanizado después de soldar: llevar la pieza soldada a cotas de precisión","blog_p58_bucket_h1":"Fabricación de cazos y accesorios de excavadora: soldadura, desgaste y alojamientos de bulón","blog_hidrolik_sistem_imalat_h1":"Fabricación Soldada de Sistemas Hidráulicos y Neumáticos"},"fr":{"blog_p84_cylbracket_title":"Chapes de vérins hydrauliques : alésages d'axe, soudage et fatigue | ArmaWeld","blog_p84_cylbracket_meta_desc":"Fabrication de supports de vérins hydrauliques (chapes, pattes, paliers de tourillon) pour engins de chantier, machines agricoles, levage et presses : alignement des alésages, usinage après soudage, bagues, détails en fatigue et contrôle.","blog_p84_cylbracket_og_title":"Chapes de vérins hydrauliques","blog_p84_cylbracket_tag":"Guide produit · Hydraulique","blog_p84_cylbracket_h1":"Chapes de vérins hydrauliques : alésages d'axe, soudage et fatigue","blog_p84_cylbracket_breadcrumb3":"Chapes de vérins","blog_p84_cylbracket_read":"6 min de lecture","blog_p84_cylbracket_body":"<p>L'effort d'un vérin hydraulique passe dans la machine par deux petits points d'attache : les supports côté corps et côté tige. Ils sont petits par rapport au reste de la pièce soudée, mais comptent parmi les zones les plus sollicitées et les plus cyclées. Beaucoup de fissures et d'usures d'axes et de bagues commencent ici.</p>\n<h2>Types courants</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Chape :</strong> deux flasques parallèles traversés par un axe.</li>\n<li><strong>Patte simple :</strong> un flasque qui entre dans la chape du vérin, souvent avec rotule.</li>\n<li><strong>Palier de tourillon :</strong> fixation à deux paliers tenant le vérin par son milieu.</li>\n<li><strong>Fixation par pied :</strong> semelle sur laquelle le vérin est boulonné.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Alignement des alésages</h2>\n<p>Dans une chape, les trous des deux flasques doivent être coaxiaux pour que l'axe entre sans forcer et que les bagues s'usent uniformément. Au soudage, les flasques se rapprochent et les trous se décalent. Les alésages de précision sont donc en général usinés après soudage en une seule prise ; s'ils sont percés avant, on laisse une surépaisseur (voir <a href=\"kaynak-sonrasi-talasli-isleme.html\">usinage après soudage</a>). L'alignement entre les supports des deux extrémités compte aussi, pour éviter tout effort latéral sur la tige.</p>\n<h2>Soudage et fatigue</h2>\n<p>Les supports sont chargés et déchargés à chaque cycle : c'est de la fatigue. Le détail de soudure en est le facteur principal :</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Des flasques assemblés à pleine pénétration offrent une classe de fatigue plus élevée que des soudures d'angle (voir <a href=\"kaynakli-baglantilarda-yorulma-fat-sinifi.html\">fatigue et classe FAT</a>).</li>\n<li>Arrêts de cordon loin des angles de tôle (contourner, ne pas s'arrêter à l'angle).</li>\n<li>Meulage ou reprise TIG du pied de cordon si nécessaire (voir <a href=\"kaynak-dikisi-taslama-ne-zaman-gerekli.html\">meulage des cordons</a>).</li>\n<li>Renfort arrière répartissant l'effort ; jamais de patte soudée directement sur tôle mince.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Bagues et graissage</h2>\n<p>Une bague remplaçable est généralement emmanchée dans l'alésage. Tolérance d'alésage (serrage), rainure et trou de graisseur doivent figurer au plan. Les bagues sont emmanchées après peinture ; la peinture ne doit pas entrer dans l'alésage.</p>\n<h2>Contrôle</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>VT et MT sur les soudures de flasques ; UT sur pleine pénétration.</li>\n<li>Entraxe, coaxialité et diamètre des alésages.</li>\n<li>Cote de montage entre les deux attaches du vérin.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Chez ArmaWeld :</strong> nous soudons les corps avec supports de vérins selon plan et notre personnel ISO 9712 niveau 2 réalise MT et UT. L'usinage après soudage des alésages est coordonné avec nos ateliers partenaires et les cotes sont consignées. <a href=\"../makine-sasesi-imalati.html\">Bâtis de machines →</a></p></div>","blog_p84_cylbracket_faq":"<h2>Questions fréquentes</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Percer avant ou après soudage ?</h3><p>Les alésages de précision sont usinés après soudage en une prise ; percés avant, ils gardent une surépaisseur.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Pourquoi les chapes fissurent-elles ?</h3><p>Par fatigue due à la charge alternée ; détails faibles et arrêts de cordon aux angles en sont les causes principales.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Quand emmancher les bagues ?</h3><p>Après peinture ; pas de peinture dans l'alésage.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Quels CND sur les supports ?</h3><p>VT et MT ; UT sur pleine pénétration.</p></div>","blog_p84_cylbracket_cta_h3":"Des pièces soudées avec attaches de vérins ?","blog_p84_cylbracket_cta_p":"Envoyez le plan ; nous chiffrerons soudage, usinage et contrôle.","blog_p84_cylbracket_cta_btn":"Demander un devis →","blog_related_h":"Articles associés","blog_p18_fatigue_h1":"Fatigue des assemblages soudés : classes FAT, courbes S-N et détails qui prolongent la durée de vie","blog_p54_postmachining_h1":"Usinage après soudage : amener une pièce soudée aux cotes de précision","blog_p58_bucket_h1":"Fabrication de godets et accessoires d’engins : soudage, usure et alésages d’axes","blog_hidrolik_sistem_imalat_h1":"Fabrication Soudée Systèmes Hydrauliques et Pneumatiques"},"it":{"blog_p84_cylbracket_title":"Supporti per cilindri idraulici: sedi perno, saldatura e fatica | ArmaWeld","blog_p84_cylbracket_meta_desc":"Produzione di supporti per cilindri idraulici (forcelle, occhioni, supporti a perno oscillante) per macchine movimento terra, agricole, di sollevamento e presse: allineamento delle sedi, lavorazione dopo saldatura, boccole, dettagli a fatica e controlli.","blog_p84_cylbracket_og_title":"Supporti per cilindri idraulici","blog_p84_cylbracket_tag":"Guida prodotto · Oleodinamica","blog_p84_cylbracket_h1":"Supporti per cilindri idraulici: sedi perno, saldatura e fatica","blog_p84_cylbracket_breadcrumb3":"Supporti per cilindri","blog_p84_cylbracket_read":"6 min di lettura","blog_p84_cylbracket_body":"<p>La forza di un cilindro idraulico entra nella macchina attraverso due piccoli punti di attacco: i supporti lato camicia e lato stelo. Sono piccoli rispetto al resto del pezzo saldato, ma sono tra le zone più sollecitate e più cicliche della macchina. Molte cricche e molta usura di perni e boccole nascono qui.</p>\n<h2>Tipologie</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Forcella:</strong> due piastre parallele attraversate da un perno.</li>\n<li><strong>Occhione singolo:</strong> una piastra che entra nella forcella del cilindro, spesso con snodo sferico.</li>\n<li><strong>Supporto a perno oscillante:</strong> attacco a due cuscinetti che regge il cilindro al centro.</li>\n<li><strong>Attacco a piede:</strong> piastra di base cui si imbullona il cilindro.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Allineamento delle sedi</h2>\n<p>In una forcella i fori delle due piastre devono essere coassiali, perché il perno entri senza forzare e le boccole si usurino in modo uniforme. In saldatura le piastre tirano verso l'interno e i fori si spostano. Le sedi di precisione si lavorano quindi di solito dopo la saldatura in un solo piazzamento; se forate prima, si lascia sovrametallo (vedi <a href=\"kaynak-sonrasi-talasli-isleme.html\">lavorazione dopo saldatura</a>). Conta anche l'allineamento tra i supporti alle due estremità, per non caricare lateralmente lo stelo.</p>\n<h2>Saldatura e fatica</h2>\n<p>I supporti si caricano e scaricano a ogni ciclo: è un carico a fatica. Il dettaglio di saldatura è il fattore principale della durata:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Piastre unite al corpo a piena penetrazione danno una classe a fatica più alta dei cordoni d'angolo (vedi <a href=\"kaynakli-baglantilarda-yorulma-fat-sinifi.html\">fatica e classe FAT</a>).</li>\n<li>Fine cordone lontano dagli spigoli (girare attorno, non fermarsi sullo spigolo).</li>\n<li>Molatura o ripassatura TIG del piede quando serve (vedi <a href=\"kaynak-dikisi-taslama-ne-zaman-gerekli.html\">molatura dei cordoni</a>).</li>\n<li>Rinforzo posteriore che distribuisca il carico; mai occhioni su lamiera sottile.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Boccole e lubrificazione</h2>\n<p>Nella sede si pianta di solito una boccola sostituibile. Tolleranza della sede (interferenza), scanalatura e foro per ingrassatore vanno a disegno. Le boccole si piantano dopo la verniciatura; la vernice non deve entrare nella sede.</p>\n<h2>Controlli</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>VT e MT sui cordoni degli occhioni; UT sulla piena penetrazione.</li>\n<li>Interasse, coassialità e diametro dei fori.</li>\n<li>Quota di montaggio tra i due attacchi del cilindro.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>In ArmaWeld:</strong> saldiamo corpi con supporti per cilindri a disegno e il nostro personale ISO 9712 livello 2 esegue MT e UT. Coordiniamo la lavorazione delle sedi dopo saldatura con officine meccaniche partner e registriamo le quote. <a href=\"../makine-sasesi-imalati.html\">Telai per macchine →</a></p></div>","blog_p84_cylbracket_faq":"<h2>Domande frequenti</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Fori prima o dopo la saldatura?</h3><p>Le sedi di precisione si lavorano dopo la saldatura in un piazzamento; se fatte prima, con sovrametallo.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Perché i supporti si criccano?</h3><p>Per fatica dovuta al carico alterno; dettagli deboli e fine cordone sugli spigoli sono le cause principali.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Quando si piantano le boccole?</h3><p>Dopo la verniciatura; niente vernice nella sede.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Quali CND sui supporti?</h3><p>VT e MT; UT sulla piena penetrazione.</p></div>","blog_p84_cylbracket_cta_h3":"Avete pezzi saldati con attacchi per cilindri?","blog_p84_cylbracket_cta_p":"Inviate il disegno; quoteremo saldatura, lavorazione e controlli.","blog_p84_cylbracket_cta_btn":"Richiedi offerta →","blog_related_h":"Articoli correlati","blog_p18_fatigue_h1":"Fatica nei giunti saldati: classi FAT, curve S-N e dettagli che allungano la vita","blog_p54_postmachining_h1":"Lavorazione meccanica dopo saldatura: portare il pezzo saldato a quote di precisione","blog_p58_bucket_h1":"Benne e attrezzature per macchine movimento terra: saldatura, usura e sedi dei perni","blog_hidrolik_sistem_imalat_h1":"Fabbricazione saldata di sistemi idraulici e pneumatici"},"nl":{"blog_p84_cylbracket_title":"Bevestigingsbeugels voor hydraulische cilinders: pengaten, lassen en vermoeiing | ArmaWeld","blog_p84_cylbracket_meta_desc":"Productie van cilinderbeugels (vorken, ogen, taplagers) voor grondverzet-, landbouw- en hijsmachines en persen: uitlijning van pengaten, nabewerking na het lassen, bussen, vermoeiingsdetails en inspectie.","blog_p84_cylbracket_og_title":"Beugels voor hydraulische cilinders","blog_p84_cylbracket_tag":"Productgids · Hydrauliek","blog_p84_cylbracket_h1":"Bevestigingsbeugels voor hydraulische cilinders: pengaten, lassen en vermoeiing","blog_p84_cylbracket_breadcrumb3":"Cilinderbeugels","blog_p84_cylbracket_read":"6 min lezen","blog_p84_cylbracket_body":"<p>De kracht van een hydraulische cilinder komt via twee kleine aansluitpunten in de machine: de beugels aan de cilinderbuis- en de zuigerstangzijde. Vergeleken met de rest van het laswerk zijn ze klein, maar ze behoren tot de zwaarst en vaakst wisselend belaste zones. Veel scheuren en veel pen- en busslijtage in de praktijk beginnen hier.</p>\n<h2>Gangbare uitvoeringen</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Vork:</strong> twee evenwijdige platen met een pen erdoorheen.</li>\n<li><strong>Enkel oog:</strong> één plaat die in de vork van de cilinder valt, vaak met kogelscharnier.</li>\n<li><strong>Taplager:</strong> tweezijdige lagering die de cilinder in het midden draagt.</li>\n<li><strong>Voetbevestiging:</strong> grondplaat waarop de cilinder wordt vastgebout.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Uitlijning van pengaten</h2>\n<p>Bij een vork moeten de gaten in beide platen in lijn liggen, zodat de pen niet klemt en de bussen gelijkmatig slijten. Bij het lassen trekken de platen naar binnen en verschuiven de gaten. Precisiegaten worden daarom meestal na het lassen in één opspanning bewerkt; worden ze eerder geboord, dan blijft er bewerkingstoeslag (zie <a href=\"kaynak-sonrasi-talasli-isleme.html\">nabewerking na het lassen</a>). Ook de uitlijning tussen de beugels aan beide cilinderuiteinden telt, zodat de zuigerstang geen zijdelingse last krijgt.</p>\n<h2>Lassen en vermoeiing</h2>\n<p>Cilinderbeugels worden elke werkcyclus belast en ontlast: vermoeiingsbelasting. Het lasdetail bepaalt de levensduur grotendeels:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Volledig doorgelaste ogen halen een hogere vermoeiingsklasse dan hoeklassen (zie <a href=\"kaynakli-baglantilarda-yorulma-fat-sinifi.html\">vermoeiing en FAT-klasse</a>).</li>\n<li>Lasuiteinden niet op plaathoeken (omlassen, niet op de hoek stoppen).</li>\n<li>Zo nodig lasteen slijpen of met TIG naglanzen (zie <a href=\"kaynak-dikisi-taslama-ne-zaman-gerekli.html\">lassen slijpen</a>).</li>\n<li>Versterking erachter om de last te spreiden; nooit een oog direct op dunne plaat.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Bussen en smering</h2>\n<p>In het pengat wordt meestal een vervangbare bus geperst. Gattolerantie (persfit), smeergroef en smeernippelgat horen op tekening. Bussen worden na het lakken geperst; er mag geen lak in het gat komen.</p>\n<h2>Inspectie</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>VT en MT op lassen van ogen; UT op volledig doorgelaste lassen.</li>\n<li>Hartafstand, coaxialiteit en diameter van de gaten.</li>\n<li>Inbouwmaat tussen beide cilinderaansluitingen.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Bij ArmaWeld:</strong> we lassen basislichamen met cilinderbeugels volgens tekening; ons personeel met ISO 9712 niveau 2 voert MT en UT uit. Nabewerking van pengaten coördineren we met partner-verspaners en de maten rapporteren we. <a href=\"../makine-sasesi-imalati.html\">Machineframes →</a></p></div>","blog_p84_cylbracket_faq":"<h2>Veelgestelde vragen</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Pengaten vóór of na het lassen?</h3><p>Precisiegaten meestal na het lassen in één opspanning; vooraf geboord alleen met toeslag.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Waarom scheuren cilinderbeugels?</h3><p>Door vermoeiing bij wisselende last; zwakke lasdetails en lasuiteinden op hoeken zijn de hoofdoorzaken.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Wanneer worden bussen geperst?</h3><p>Na het lakken; geen lak in het gat.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Welk NDO op beugels?</h3><p>VT en MT; UT op volledig doorgelaste lassen.</p></div>","blog_p84_cylbracket_cta_h3":"Laswerk met cilinderaansluitingen?","blog_p84_cylbracket_cta_p":"Stuur de tekening; we offreren lassen, nabewerking en inspectie.","blog_p84_cylbracket_cta_btn":"Offerte aanvragen →","blog_related_h":"Gerelateerde artikelen","blog_p18_fatigue_h1":"Vermoeiing van lasverbindingen: FAT-klassen, S-N-lijnen en details die de levensduur verlengen","blog_p54_postmachining_h1":"Verspanen na het lassen: lasdelen op precisiemaat brengen","blog_p58_bucket_h1":"Graafbakken en aanbouwdelen bouwen: lassen, slijtage en pengaten","blog_hidrolik_sistem_imalat_h1":"Gelaste productie van hydraulische en pneumatische systemen"},"no":{"blog_p84_cylbracket_title":"Festebraketter for hydraulikksylindre: bolthull, sveising og utmatting | ArmaWeld","blog_p84_cylbracket_meta_desc":"Produksjon av sylinderbraketter (gaffelfester, ører, tappelagre) for anleggs-, landbruks- og løftemaskiner og presser: oppretting av bolthull, maskinering etter sveising, foringer, utmattingsdetaljer og kontroll.","blog_p84_cylbracket_og_title":"Braketter for hydraulikksylindre","blog_p84_cylbracket_tag":"Produktguide · Hydraulikk","blog_p84_cylbracket_h1":"Festebraketter for hydraulikksylindre: bolthull, sveising og utmatting","blog_p84_cylbracket_breadcrumb3":"Sylinderbraketter","blog_p84_cylbracket_read":"6 min lesing","blog_p84_cylbracket_body":"<p>Kraften fra en hydraulikksylinder går inn i maskinen gjennom to små festepunkter: brakettene på sylinderrør- og stangsiden. De er små sammenlignet med resten av sveisedelen, men hører til de mest belastede og mest syklisk belastede sonene. Mange sprekker og mye bolt- og foringsslitasje starter her.</p>\n<h2>Vanlige typer</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Gaffelfeste:</strong> to parallelle plater med bolt gjennom.</li>\n<li><strong>Enkelt øre:</strong> én plate som går inn i sylinderens gaffel, ofte med kuleledd.</li>\n<li><strong>Tappelager:</strong> tosidig lagring som bærer sylinderen på midten.</li>\n<li><strong>Fotfeste:</strong> bunnplate som sylinderen boltes til.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Oppretting av bolthull</h2>\n<p>I et gaffelfeste må hullene i begge platene ligge på linje, slik at bolten går inn uten å kile og foringene slites jevnt. Under sveising trekker platene seg innover og hullene forskyves. Presisjonshull maskineres derfor normalt etter sveising i ett oppspenn; bores de før, legges det igjen maskineringstillegg (se <a href=\"kaynak-sonrasi-talasli-isleme.html\">maskinering etter sveising</a>). Også innbyrdes oppretting mellom brakettene i begge sylinderender teller, så stempelstangen ikke får sidelast.</p>\n<h2>Sveising og utmatting</h2>\n<p>Sylinderbraketter belastes og avlastes hver arbeidssyklus: utmattingslast. Sveisedetaljen styrer levetiden i stor grad:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fullt gjennomsveiste ører gir høyere utmattingsklasse enn kilsveiser (se <a href=\"kaynakli-baglantilarda-yorulma-fat-sinifi.html\">utmatting og FAT-klasse</a>).</li>\n<li>Sveiseender bort fra platehjørner (sveis rundt, ikke stopp i hjørnet).</li>\n<li>Ved behov sliping av sveisetå eller TIG-dressing (se <a href=\"kaynak-dikisi-taslama-ne-zaman-gerekli.html\">sliping av sveiser</a>).</li>\n<li>Forsterkning bak som fordeler lasten; aldri øre direkte på tynn plate.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Foringer og smøring</h2>\n<p>I bolthullet presses normalt en utskiftbar foring. Hulltoleranse (pressmonn), smørespor og hull for smørenippel skal stå på tegningen. Foringer presses inn etter maling; maling skal ikke inn i hullet.</p>\n<h2>Kontroll</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>VT og MT på øresveiser; UT på fullt gjennomsveiste sveiser.</li>\n<li>Senteravstand, koaksialitet og diameter på hullene.</li>\n<li>Monteringsmål mellom sylinderens to fester.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Hos ArmaWeld:</strong> vi sveiser rammer med sylinderbraketter etter tegning, og vårt personell med ISO 9712 nivå 2 utfører MT og UT. Maskinering av bolthull etter sveising koordineres med partnerverksteder, og målene rapporteres. <a href=\"../makine-sasesi-imalati.html\">Maskinrammer →</a></p></div>","blog_p84_cylbracket_faq":"<h2>Ofte stilte spørsmål</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Bolthull før eller etter sveising?</h3><p>Presisjonshull maskineres normalt etter sveising i ett oppspenn; bores de før, med tillegg.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Hvorfor sprekker sylinderbraketter?</h3><p>Utmatting fra vekslende last; svake sveisedetaljer og sveiseender i hjørner er hovedårsakene.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Når presses foringer inn?</h3><p>Etter maling; ingen maling i hullet.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Hvilken NDT på braketter?</h3><p>VT og MT; UT på fullt gjennomsveiste sveiser.</p></div>","blog_p84_cylbracket_cta_h3":"Sveisedeler med sylinderfester?","blog_p84_cylbracket_cta_p":"Send tegningen; vi gir tilbud på sveising, maskinering og kontroll.","blog_p84_cylbracket_cta_btn":"Be om tilbud →","blog_related_h":"Relaterte artikler","blog_p18_fatigue_h1":"Utmatting i sveiste forbindelser: FAT-klasser, S-N-kurver og detaljer som forlenger levetiden","blog_p54_postmachining_h1":"Maskinering etter sveising: få sveisede deler til presisjonsmål","blog_p58_bucket_h1":"Gravemaskinskuffer og redskaper: sveising, slitasje og bolthull","blog_hidrolik_sistem_imalat_h1":"Sveiset produksjon av hydrauliske og pneumatiske systemer"}};for(var l in d){var t=T[l]||(T[l]={});for(var k in d[l])t[k]=d[l][k];}})();
